    ],
    "text_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
     "text": "<p>Innolux TFT LCD displays are available in sizes from 5.7” to 85&quot;, all of which we can add a touch option. They offer:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A wide range of operating temperature, resolution and interface types</li>\r\n<li>Wide viewing angle</li>\r\n<li>Low power consumption</li>\r\n<li>Outstanding image quality</li>\r\n<li>An ability to be customized based on client requirements</li>\r\n<li>Options include narrow bezel technology perfect for video wall applications (ranging from 1 – 3.5mm)</li>\r\n<li>Shelf display modules are available</li>\r\n<li>In-cell touch modules are available in certain sizes and models</li>\r\n<li>Support for long product lifecycles, ideal for clients who use their displays in products for which they must secure medical, government or safety certifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Macnica offers a variety of services to enhance Innolux displays, including <a href=\"https://www.macnica.com/americas/mai/en/products/displays/macnica-displays-customization/#tabs-dcc6651634-item-5c288bc1f9-tab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>OPTICAL BONDING</b></a>, <a href=\"https://www.macnica.com/americas/mai/en/products/displays/macnica-displays-customization/#tabs-dcc6651634-item-88aaca9ea4-tab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>TOUCH SCREEN</b></a> and <a href=\"https://www.macnica.com/americas/mai/en/products/displays/macnica-displays-customization/#tabs-dcc6651634-item-9e947391e3-tab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>COVER GLASS OPTIONS</b></a>, and <b>CUSTOMIZED WAREHOUSING AND LOGISTICS.</b></p>\r\n",
     "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 21 2026 14:08:21 GMT+0000",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
     "textIsRich": "true"
    }
   },
